    "summary": "Increment 2: offline reproduction from bounded, host-retained replay bundles; configurable tenant-only or principal-scoped equivalence for candidate comparison; explicit availability, coverage and abstention; named dataset splits and temperature fitting. Amends 002 with replay and request documents and typed loading diagnostics, and 003 with opt-in bounded capture of supplied values. Live re-execution is deferred. Synthetic fixtures establish mechanics only, never empirical quality.\n",
